    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, it's exactly that. it's like i'm always on high alert, just trying to read between the lines so i don't say the wrong thing or look the wrong way. and the worst part is knowing it'll never change. it's never going to get easier or feel natural. it's just gonna be this endless, draining loop of pretending until i die.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
